  "description": "BALMEI crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C96 H84 Dy4 N8 O36. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1C (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.659-3.892 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.96-111.01°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(μ3-OH)4(nmc)8]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
